{
  "_about": "Field Watch topics: what the weekly search looks for, tied to the test each topic bears on. Edit freely. arxiv = arXiv API search_query (abs:, ti:, cat:, AND/OR/ANDNOT; quote phrases). crossref = free-text query for journals arXiv does not cover. terms = words that score a paper's title and abstract; min_score = how many must appear. Read by tools/field_watch.py. require = groups of words; a paper must contain at least one word from every group. exclude = words that rule a paper out. baseline = the arXiv area a topic is measured against for share of interest. pubmed = PubMed search for interest in topics arXiv barely covers; nsf / nih = phrases for funding trends (each phrase searched separately, awards counted once) (tools/field_trends.py).",
